
# Pre-rendered pages. tools/prerender.cjs writes one HTML file per URL in
# sitemap.xml -- about 1,570 files and 220 MB, rewritten whole on every build.
# They are derived from the data, never edited by hand, and reproducible in
# about a hundred seconds, so they are generated on the deploy runner instead
# of being carried in the history. See the pre-render step in deploy.yml.
/en/
/ar/
